WEBVTT

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:02.000
♫ What heart heard of,

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:05.000
ghost had guessed: ♫

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.000
♫ It's the blight

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.000
man was born for, ♫

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:19.000
♫ It is Margaret

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.000
that you mourn for ♫

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.000
Thank you so much.